{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/2309418408f1d407877cfe2f068d991a.avif?t=1771590292\" width=502 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an enchanting journey into the heart of a mysterious and isolated forest in this story heavy adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iki and Tika know nothing else but what the forest has taught them but will it be enough to survive and unveil the extraordinary secrets lurking within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/872d33b4219fbb0f15f68a30c525a786.poster.avif?t=1771590292\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/872d33b4219fbb0f15f68a30c525a786.webm?t=1771590292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/872d33b4219fbb0f15f68a30c525a786.mp4?t=1771590292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow them into a captivating, lush and atmospheric environment where dangerous creatures and human raiders are threatening the siblings with unforeseen challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Children of the Forest&quot; is a tale told from Iki\u2019s perspective. With determination, kindness and a quirky personality - she is eager to face the world with all its wonders, struggles and tragedies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/850135a8a60706f15e5e3a0a832e1699.poster.avif?t=1771590292\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/850135a8a60706f15e5e3a0a832e1699.webm?t=1771590292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/850135a8a60706f15e5e3a0a832e1699.mp4?t=1771590292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between the spectacles of exploration and story - Iki and Tika find themselves expanding their home, learning to cook, sew new clothing, care for animals, building their garden, and more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow along Iki in her relic hunting endeavours to find forgotten and powerful ancient relics buried deep within the unknown areas of the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/5a62893694f0d8ec5ce4b9fc4e0959b6.poster.avif?t=1771590292\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/5a62893694f0d8ec5ce4b9fc4e0959b6.webm?t=1771590292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/5a62893694f0d8ec5ce4b9fc4e0959b6.mp4?t=1771590292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/8f4e1322a64df06bc42d353bce703339.avif?t=1771590292\" width=502 height=66 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully voice acted RPG adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a beautiful and carefully crafted world full with exploration and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find powerful relics from an ancient past that can be used in both exploration and combat scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about the raiders invading the forest, not everything is what it seems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the unique relationship between Iki and her brother Tika as they face the dangers of the forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide between different answers in dialogues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your home with lots of new buildings and features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Iki and Tika by crafting them new adorable outfits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the amazing soundtrack composed by Rapha\u00ebl Hinojosa</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2185100?t=1771590292","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771590292","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771590292","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771590292","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/2309418408f1d407877cfe2f068d991a.avif?t=1771590292\" width=502 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an enchanting journey into the heart of a mysterious and isolated forest in this story heavy adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iki and Tika know nothing else but what the forest has taught them but will it be enough to survive and unveil the extraordinary secrets lurking within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/872d33b4219fbb0f15f68a30c525a786.poster.avif?t=1771590292\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/872d33b4219fbb0f15f68a30c525a786.webm?t=1771590292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/872d33b4219fbb0f15f68a30c525a786.mp4?t=1771590292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow them into a captivating, lush and atmospheric environment where dangerous creatures and human raiders are threatening the siblings with unforeseen challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Children of the Forest&quot; is a tale told from Iki\u2019s perspective. With determination, kindness and a quirky personality - she is eager to face the world with all its wonders, struggles and tragedies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/850135a8a60706f15e5e3a0a832e1699.poster.avif?t=1771590292\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/850135a8a60706f15e5e3a0a832e1699.webm?t=1771590292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/850135a8a60706f15e5e3a0a832e1699.mp4?t=1771590292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In between the spectacles of exploration and story - Iki and Tika find themselves expanding their home, learning to cook, sew new clothing, care for animals, building their garden, and more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow along Iki in her relic hunting endeavours to find forgotten and powerful ancient relics buried deep within the unknown areas of the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/5a62893694f0d8ec5ce4b9fc4e0959b6.poster.avif?t=1771590292\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/5a62893694f0d8ec5ce4b9fc4e0959b6.webm?t=1771590292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/5a62893694f0d8ec5ce4b9fc4e0959b6.mp4?t=1771590292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/extras/8f4e1322a64df06bc42d353bce703339.avif?t=1771590292\" width=502 height=66 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully voice acted RPG adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a beautiful and carefully crafted world full with exploration and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find powerful relics from an ancient past that can be used in both exploration and combat scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about the raiders invading the forest, not everything is what it seems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the unique relationship between Iki and her brother Tika as they face the dangers of the forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide between different answers in dialogues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your home with lots of new buildings and features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Iki and Tika by crafting them new adorable outfits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the amazing soundtrack composed by Rapha\u00ebl Hinojosa</p></li></ul>","developers":["Rainynewt"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/header.jpg?t=1771590292","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2185100/2062183276/523475cd32f3731e9ef66a808b5d5bd85c84d4a8/1771588970/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771590291","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2185100/2062183276/523475cd32f3731e9ef66a808b5d5bd85c84d4a8/1771588970/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771590291","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2185100/2062183276/523475cd32f3731e9ef66a808b5d5bd85c84d4a8/1771588970/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771590291","id":257291066,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257291066/3875a4a45b694a2195f4ea995102821fe2cee7ac/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771590291"}],"name":"Children of the Forest","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GT 1030 or better<br></li><li><st