71590292"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/ss_d747b6c205ed76452ba755b7ea2dbc5261dc58f7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771590292","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185100/ss_d747b6c205ed76452ba755b7ea2dbc5261dc58f7.600x338.jpg?t=1771590292"}],"short_description":"Iki and Tika live deep within a mysterious forest. Follow their enchanting journey as they find themselves amidst an imminent new threat. Children of the Forest is a story-driven adventure game about two siblings venturing through a land filled with extraordinary remnants from an ancient past.","steam_appid":2185100,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://www.rennertgames.com/contact"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}